#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:5
#: 06386cb756f84dcc8921af7caa65e60f
msgid "Lowrance Elite Ti2 Sonar"
msgstr "Lowrance Elite Ti2 声呐"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:7
#: c4852e03e42d4c1ab9770c924f84ff0b
msgid ""
"The `Lowrance Elite Ti2 sonar "
"<https://www.lowrance.com/lowrance/type/fishfinders-"
"chartplotters/elite-7-ti2-us-inland-ai-3-in-1/>`__ can be connected to the "
"autopilot so that the sonar can use the autopilot's position estimate (which"
" is normally better than the sonar's built-in GPS) and the autopilot can "
"record and report the sonar's simple depth."
msgstr ""
"`Lowrance Elite Ti2 声呐 <https://www.lowrance.com/lowrance/type/fishfinders-"
"chartplotters/elite-7-ti2-us-inland-ai-3-in-1/>`__ "
"可连接到飞控，使声呐能够使用飞控的位置估计（通常比声呐内置 GPS 更准确），同时飞控可以记录和报告声呐的简单深度数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:12
#: d9378a6c1bc84e099adfa9c7d3e8c779
msgid ""
"Discussion of this sonar's setup is `here "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/lowrance-nmea-0183-to-cube-"
"orange/86057/8>`__"
msgstr ""
"关于此声呐设置的讨论 `在此 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/lowrance-nmea-0183-to-cube-"
"orange/86057/8>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:15
#: f8ec6d8f591849f581756d2c8b85bb79
msgid "Hardware Setup"
msgstr "硬件设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:20
#: 30536bdd67b84767bf0342f4d7ab4ac6
msgid ""
"Purchase an `RS422 to TTL converter <https://www.amazon.com/LM-bi-"
"directional-Full-duplex-single-chip-microcomputer/dp/B01NGTMROI>`__"
msgstr ""
"购买一个 `RS422 转 TTL 转换器 <https://www.amazon.com/LM-bi-directional-Full-duplex-"
"single-chip-microcomputer/dp/B01NGTMROI>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:21
#: 85f79171f39f4472a25034ef24485057
msgid ""
"Connect the sonar's NMEA 0183 pins to the left side of the converter as "
"shown above"
msgstr "将声呐的 NMEA 0183 引脚连接到转换器左侧，如上图所示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:22
#: 94f3f7b24b534905aff3b32d1dfc6e47
msgid ""
"Connect one of the autopilot's serial ports to the right side of the "
"converter as shown above"
msgstr "将飞控的某个串口连接到转换器右侧，如上图所示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:25
#: 871c41dce5014f4ba622762f5a13e57b
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:27
#: 1df95651a5994186846950ab64393d79
msgid ""
"If the autopilot's Serial2 port (aka Telem2) is used then the following "
"parameters should be set:"
msgstr "如果使用飞控的 Serial2 端口（即 Telem2），则应设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:29
#: 313a01b9666e4527a6b4f93e37a10bae
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Lidar)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9（激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:30
#: b9c8daa63d7d48bbb1fa9c283410bc52
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 38 (38400 baud) to match the baud rate "
"the Elite is using"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 38（38400 波特率），与 Elite 使用的波特率匹配"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:32
#: b185af9b412e4ff5bef412f8c26b38d8
msgid "These rangefinder parameters should also be set:"
msgstr "还应设置以下测距仪参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:34
#: 66d622181beb483e897afbd07f256675
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 17 (NMEA)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 17（NMEA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:35
#: 77086d10c2764f9bb6494f4df0007c9b
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.13"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:36
#: e41c403595d24b00a4dfd29c75aeb93e
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 300 (300m)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 300（300m）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:37
#: eb2b8e6d650c44999280cd167f468c5d
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT <RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25 (down)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT <RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25（向下）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:40
#: b26b44b615e54ba0b55458c605178869
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:42
#: 624aa6b2973848c7acd3d9cd87bd9225
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面的状态标签页中查看。请注意查找 「rangefinder1」。"
